# Example environment for the same-origin furnish proxy (functions/api/furnish*).
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) for local `wrangler pages dev`, and set the SAME
# key as a Cloudflare Pages environment variable for production. The value is a SECRET and must
# never be committed — this example ships with a blank placeholder only.
#
# Where to get it: https://www.meshy.ai/ → account → API keys.
MESHY_API_KEY=
